# Day 24 - generated by infra/scripts/select-bicepparam.ps1 on every
# azd provision; infra/main.dev.bicepparam and infra/main.prod.bicepparam
# are the real, committed sources - this copy is never the thing to edit.
infra/main.bicepparam

# Day 27 - the ARM template `az bicep build --file main.bicep` emits next to
# the source. A build artifact: azd compiles the .bicep itself on every
# provision and never reads this, so a committed copy could only ever be a
# stale second version of main.bicep.
infra/main.json
